#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:10
msgid "Physics Backends"
msgstr "物理后端"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:12
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports PhysX, Newton, and OvPhysX through shared asset, sensor, "
"and scene APIs. Choose a backend for the runtime and solvers you need, then "
"select a preset supported by your task. See :ref:`backends-and-presets` for "
"launch commands."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 通过共享的资产、传感器和场景 API 支持 PhysX、Newton 和 "
"OvPhysX。根据所需运行时和求解器选择后端，再选择任务支持的预设。启动命令见 :ref:`backends-and-presets`。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:18
msgid "Choose a backend"
msgstr "选择后端"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:23
#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:57
msgid "Isaac Sim PhysX"
msgstr "Isaac Sim PhysX"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:27
msgid ""
"PhysX simulation through Isaac Sim and Omniverse Kit, with TGS and PGS "
"solvers."
msgstr "通过 Isaac Sim 和 Omniverse Kit 运行 PhysX 仿真，提供 TGS 和 PGS 求解器。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:30
#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:72
msgid "Newton"
msgstr "Newton"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:34
msgid ""
"Warp-native simulation without Isaac Sim. Choose from MJWarp, Kamino, VBD, "
"and MPM solvers."
msgstr "无需 Isaac Sim 的 Warp 原生仿真，可选择 MJWarp、Kamino、VBD 和 MPM 求解器。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:37
#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:87
msgid "OvPhysX"
msgstr "OvPhysX"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:41
msgid ""
"PhysX simulation without Omniverse Kit, configured through USD. Install with"
" the ``ovphysx`` extra."
msgstr "无需 Omniverse Kit 的 PhysX 仿真，通过 USD 配置。使用 ``ovphysx`` extra 安装。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:44
msgid ""
"Follow :ref:`isaaclab-installation-root` for the supported installation "
"paths and current optional extras. Do not combine OvPhysX with a Kit runtime"
" in the same process."
msgstr ""
"受支持的安装方式和当前可选依赖组见 :ref:`isaaclab-installation-root` 。不要在同一个进程中混用 OvPhysX 和 "
"Kit 运行时。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:48
msgid ""
"For the general PhysX--Newton policy validation workflow, see "
":doc:`/source/how-to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton`. When a "
"checkpoint's joint or body ordering differs from the target backend, use the"
" :ref:`articulation ordering guide <joint-and-body-ordering>`."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 与 Newton 之间的一般策略验证流程见 :doc:`/source/how-"
"to/transfer_policies_between_physx_and_newton` 。检查点使用的关节或刚体顺序与目标后端不一致时，请参阅 "
":ref:`关节系统顺序指南 <joint-and-body-ordering>` 。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:59
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim PhysX runs through Isaac Sim and Omniverse Kit. It uses the "
"Temporal Gauss-Seidel (TGS) solver by default, with Projective Gauss-Seidel "
"(PGS) also available. Configure scene settings through "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` and asset properties through "
":doc:`schema_cfgs`. Large or contact-rich scenes may need additional GPU "
"buffer capacity."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim PhysX 通过 Isaac Sim 和 Omniverse Kit "
"运行，默认采用时序高斯—赛德尔（TGS）求解器，也支持投影高斯—赛德尔（PGS）求解器。场景设置通过 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg` 配置，资产属性通过 :doc:`schema_cfgs` "
"配置。大型场景或接触密集的场景可能需要更大的 GPU 缓冲区容量。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:65
msgid ""
"See :doc:`the Isaac Sim PhysX guide <physics-backends/physx>` for runtime "
"details and :ref:`physx-solver-tuning` for solver and buffer settings."
msgstr ""
"运行时详情见 :doc:`Isaac Sim PhysX 指南 <physics-backends/physx>`，求解器与缓冲区设置见 "
":ref:`physx-solver-tuning`。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:74
msgid ""
"Newton runs on Warp without requiring Isaac Sim. Its solvers cover different"
" simulation needs: MJWarp and Kamino for rigid robots, VBD for cloth and "
"soft bodies, and MPM for particle materials. Configure the backend with "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` and select a solver through "
"``solver_cfg``. Native Warp arrays are available for custom simulation code."
msgstr ""
"Newton 基于 Warp 运行，无需 Isaac Sim。其求解器覆盖不同仿真需求：MJWarp 和 Kamino 用于刚性机器人，VBD "
"用于布料和软体，MPM 用于粒子材料。使用 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` 配置后端，并通过 "
"``solver_cfg`` 选择求解器。自定义仿真代码也可直接使用原生 Warp 数组。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:80
msgid ""
"See :doc:`the Newton guide <physics-backends/newton>` for solver choices, "
"tuning guides, and native data access."
msgstr "求解器选择、调优指南和原生数据访问见 :doc:`Newton 指南 <physics-backends/newton>`。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:89
msgid ""
"OvPhysX runs PhysX without Isaac Sim or Omniverse Kit. It supports rigid "
"objects, articulations, contact and motion sensors, and CUDA-based "
"deformables, and can pair with OVRTX for rendering. Scene-level solver "
"settings come primarily from USD's ``PhysicsScene``; "
":class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` holds additional settings such as "
"GPU buffer capacities. It cannot share a process with Kit."
msgstr ""
"OvPhysX 无需 Isaac Sim 或 Omniverse Kit 即可运行 PhysX。它支持刚体、关节系统、接触与运动传感器，以及基于 "
"CUDA 的可变形体，也可配合 OVRTX 渲染。场景级求解器设置主要来自 USD 的 "
"``PhysicsScene``，:class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` 保存 GPU "
"缓冲区容量等额外设置。OvPhysX 无法与 Kit 共用进程。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:95
msgid ""
"See :doc:`the OvPhysX guide <physics-backends/ovphysx>` for installation, "
"supported features, and their configuration limits."
msgstr "安装、受支持功能及配置限制见 :doc:`OvPhysX 指南 <physics-backends/ovphysx>`。"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:100
msgid "Find supported tasks and APIs"
msgstr "查找受支持的任务和 API"

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:102
msgid ""
"Backend support is task-specific. Use :doc:`/source/isaaclab/environments` "
"to browse registered environments and presets, or ask a task for its current"
" choices:"
msgstr ""
"每个任务支持的后端有所不同。可在 :doc:`/source/isaaclab/environments` "
"中查看已注册环境及预设，也可直接查询任务当前提供的选项："

#: source/concepts/physics_backends.rst:111
msgid ""
"The help output is the source of truth for that task's ``physics=`` choices."
" For native solver data and views, see the :ref:`PhysX <physx-native-"
"access>`, :ref:`Newton <newton-native-access>`, and :ref:`OvPhysX <ovphysx-"
"native-access>` access guides. For field-level configuration, follow the "
"generated API links for :class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg`, "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg`, its solver configurations, and "
":class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg`."
msgstr ""
"该任务的 ``physics=`` 可选值以帮助输出为准。原生求解器数据和视图见 :ref:`PhysX <physx-native-"
"access>`、:ref:`Newton <newton-native-access>` 和 :ref:`OvPhysX <ovphysx-"
"native-access>` 访问指南。各字段的配置见 "
":class:`~isaaclab_physx.physics.PhysxCfg`、:class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg`"
" 及其求解器配置，以及 :class:`~isaaclab_ov.physics.OvPhysxCfg` 的 API 链接。"
